{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type PreactFormType<TOptions> = TOptions extends FormOptions<infer TFormData, infer TFormValidators, infer TSubmitReturn, infer TComponents> ? PreactFormApi<TFormData, PreactFormTypeErrorTypes<TFormValidators, TSubmitReturn>, TComponents extends AnyPreactFormComponentMap ? TComponents : DefaultPreactFormComponentMap> : never;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/preact-form/src/PreactForm/formType.public.ts#L55","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/preact-form/src/PreactForm/formType.public.ts:55"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Derives the Preact form API type represented by a reusable options object."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Use it to type props for components that belong to one known form shape. It\npreserves the inferred form data and any components registered through\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"appFormOptions"},{"type":"text","value":". Options such as "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"onSubmit"},{"type":"text","value":" can be defined either in the\nshared options or when the form is created in the component."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"toptions","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TOptions"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TOptions"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"AnyFormOptions"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The reusable form or app-form options from which the API derives its form data, error, and registered-component types."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"const profileOptions = formOptions({\n  defaultValues: { name: '' },\n})\n\ntype ProfileForm = PreactFormType<typeof profileOptions>\n\nfunction NameField(props: {\n  form: ProfileForm\n}) {\n  return (\n    <props.form.Field name=\"name\">\n      {(field) => <input value={field.value} />}\n    </props.form.Field>\n  )\n}","lang":"tsx"}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"toptions","text":"TOptions","level":3},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype PreactFormType<TOptions> = TOptions extends FormOptions<infer TFormData, infer TFormValidators, infer TSubmitReturn, infer TComponents> ? PreactFormApi<TFormData, PreactFormTypeErrorTypes<TFormValidators, TSubmitReturn>, TComponents extends AnyPreactFormComponentMap ? TComponents : DefaultPreactFormComponentMap> : never;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/preact-form/src/PreactForm/formType.public.ts:55](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/preact-form/src/PreactForm/formType.public.ts#L55)\n\nDerives the Preact form API type represented by a reusable options object.\n\nUse it to type props for components that belong to one known form shape. It\npreserves the inferred form data and any components registered through\n`appFormOptions`. Options such as `onSubmit` can be defined either in the\nshared options or when the form is created in the component.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TOptions\n\n`TOptions` *extends* `AnyFormOptions`\n\nThe reusable form or app-form options from which the API derives its form data, error, and registered-component types.\n\n## Example\n\n```tsx\nconst profileOptions = formOptions({\n  defaultValues: { name: '' },\n})\n\ntype ProfileForm = PreactFormType<typeof profileOptions>\n\nfunction NameField(props: {\n  form: ProfileForm\n}) {\n  return (\n    <props.form.Field name=\"name\">\n      {(field) => <input value={field.value} />}\n    </props.form.Field>\n  )\n}\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: PreactFormType\ntitle: PreactFormType\n---\n\n```ts\ntype PreactFormType<TOptions> = TOptions extends FormOptions<infer TFormData, infer TFormValidators, infer TSubmitReturn, infer TComponents> ? PreactFormApi<TFormData, PreactFormTypeErrorTypes<TFormValidators, TSubmitReturn>, TComponents extends AnyPreactFormComponentMap ? TComponents : DefaultPreactFormComponentMap> : never;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/preact-form/src/PreactForm/formType.public.ts:55](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/preact-form/src/PreactForm/formType.public.ts#L55)\n\nDerives the Preact form API type represented by a reusable options object.\n\nUse it to type props for components that belong to one known form shape. It\npreserves the inferred form data and any components registered through\n`appFormOptions`. Options such as `onSubmit` can be defined either in the\nshared options or when the form is created in the component.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TOptions\n\n`TOptions` *extends* `AnyFormOptions`\n\nThe reusable form or app-form options from which the API derives its form data, error, and registered-component types.\n\n## Example\n\n```tsx\nconst profileOptions = formOptions({\n  defaultValues: { name: '' },\n})\n\ntype ProfileForm = PreactFormType<typeof profileOptions>\n\nfunction NameField(props: {\n  form: ProfileForm\n}) {\n  return (\n    <props.form.Field name=\"name\">\n      {(field) => <input value={field.value} />}\n    </props.form.Field>\n  )\n}\n```\n"}
